            "review_title": "Review at Quan An Hong Duc",
            "review_text": "Anna S\nMalaysia1137 contributions\n0\nHighly recommended, great place\nMar 2025 • Couples\nPlaced Is the restaurant in a quiet side street of Hung Vuong, the central traffic axis, You will find there a very pleasant, relaxed atmosphere.\nThe guests on our visits were of different backgrounds and ages but clearly recognizable was the dominance of locals and the complete absence of Russians. Accordingly, the menu looks like: There is a wide range of food from Indochinese cuisine. Also pleasing are the cheap prices. \nOur food was excellent – tasteful and the size of the portions was also remarkable. But it wasn't just the delicious food we liked so much. It was particularly pleasing that we found good contact with Vietnamese. \nThe service and staff were excellent: nimble and friendly. On our second evening we were already treated like regulars. You were no longer a stranger.\nConclusion: We felt very comfortable and will definitely come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten April 25, 2025",
