            "review_title": "Review at Quan An Hong Duc",
            "review_text": "Michael V\nTweed Heads, Australia20 contributions\n0\nLoved it!\nMar 2019 • Couples\nQuick service, food was very good, beers were cold and cheap. It’s a very basic simple restaurant , we had dinner for 2 and 4 beers for under $10 AUD. A much better dining experience was had than the previous night at one of the big live seafood restaurants. We would come here again for sure, food was great and cheap, and we love watching Vietnam life going past on the street while relaxing and dining.\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2019",
