            "review_text": "Elly\nGothenburg, Sweden260 contributions\n0\nChicken instead of veg/didn't get food\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nI made sure to say in Vietnamese that I am vegetarian and asked if the vegetable soup was vegetarian. The owner (?) or person who seemed to be responsible ensured me it was so I ordered it. The soup was chicken stock based and there were meat residue in it. I sent it back and said that I would like to have a vegetarian soup as ordered and what did I get? Nothing at all. Noone even talked to me or said that they didn't have soup and I should order something else. I simply got ignored. Sorry to use language like that but this is one seriously crappy place.\nRead more\nWritten February 6, 2019",
