            "review_title": "Review at Quan An Hong Duc",
            "review_text": "Rhonda C\nOmemee, Ontario, Canada11 contributions\n0\nWorst Restaurant in Asia!!\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nI have to say that by far this is the worst restaurant my wife and I have ever been too in Asia in 4.5 weeks!! I like to give a restaurant at least 2 chances, but I think 4 chances is enough. First visit didn't get any service, so we left. \n\nSecond visit service was ok at least we got served our beef noodle soup(was ok for the price) \n\nThird time was for breakfast steak/egg on hot skillet & Omelet(was great price, but wasn't what my wife wanted even when she pointed to on the menu) \n\nForth visit was absolutely horrible, we once again ordered breakfast and my wife once again asked for something she wanted and never got it and for myself my breakfast never showed up!!! The only reason we gave it this many chances is our hotel was less then 10 second walk. All the lady staff are miserable, they seem to hate they're lives!! One male waiter seems to have personality.\n\nI spoke to with manager and all they were concerned with was the bill being paid. So if your desperate and want ok food at cheap prices and feel like your not wanted and want to watch angry wait staff this is the place for you!!! One star is too much, it should be minus four stars. Do yourself a favour and go somewhere else.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 1, 2019",
